    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυστήριον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμητήριον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυστηρίοις: θυμιατηρίοις</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυστήριος</span></b> , ὁ, epith. of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			455.31
		</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύστης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύ̆σι-τας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sacrificing priest</i> (Cret.), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύστινον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχινον</span>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δὲ μεσοτριβῆ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύστρα</span></b> , τά,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1026.24
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>).</div>
